    "title": "State Agency Opposes AES Rate Hike - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ryan Hedrick ,\n12 hours ago INDIANAPOLIS — A state consumer agency says AES Indiana shouldn’t raise electric rates and is instead recommending a cut. The Indiana Office of Utility Consumer Counselor (OUCC) filed its response this week, saying AES hasn’t shown enough proof to justify higher bills. The company wants to raise rates by about $21 a month for most customers by 2027. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 37",
